WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.839
[man speaking indistinctly
over walkie-talkie]

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.774
- FRONT OF HOUSE IS CLEAR.

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.243
- HUH?
DID YOU HEAR THAT?

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.116
- MUST'VE BEEN NOTHING.

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:12.272
- BACK PATIO'S CLEAR.

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:57.117
[woman laughing]

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:07.127
- [grunts]

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:23.976
- [gasps]

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:25.545
- SHH.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.190
- NOW IT'S MY TURN TO PLAY.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.796
- [snaps fingers]

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:46.832
[gun cocks]

00:02:46.865 --> 00:02:49.202
[woman screams]

00:02:55.941 --> 00:02:56.809
[guns cock]

00:02:56.842 --> 00:02:59.445
- [gasps]

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:09.755
OH.

00:03:09.788 --> 00:03:13.025
- [chuckles]

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:14.527
CAROL.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.762
- [gasps]
TEAGUE!

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:20.866
- I THOUGHT I KILLED YOU
THE FIRST TIME, MR. TEAGUE.

00:03:20.899 --> 00:03:24.570
I PROMISE I WILL NOT MAKE
THE SAME MISTAKE TWICE.

00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:26.272
- [breathes deeply]

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:34.447
- YOU ARE A GOOD COP,
MR. TEAGUE,

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.682
BUT A LOUSY FIGHTER.

00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:38.584
- UGH! AH!

00:03:38.617 --> 00:03:41.454
UGH! UGH! OH! UGH!

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:44.223
UGH! OH! UGH! OH! UGH!

00:03:44.256 --> 00:03:45.725
OH!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.697
- NO! TEAGUE!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:52.899
NO!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.804
- OH, SNAP, MR. TEAGUE.

00:04:02.107 --> 00:04:04.477
[body thuds]

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.579
- SNAP INDEED.

00:04:09.948 --> 00:04:13.620
- OH.
[chuckles]

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:20.726
TEAGUE...

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:22.061
YOU SAVED MY LIFE.

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:24.297
- NO, CAROL...

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.698
YOU SAVED MINE.

00:04:38.977 --> 00:04:41.113
[bones crack]
OH.

00:04:41.146 --> 00:04:42.748
OH, [bleep].

00:04:42.781 --> 00:04:44.350 line:92%
OH, [bleep].

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:50.323 line:92%
[bones cracking]

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:51.724
THAT'S JUST--

00:04:53.959 --> 00:04:54.959
[bones crack]

